  "id": 294,
  "description": "# 🐉 Velskud 🐉\n\n Velskud, a name once whispered across the lands as a symbol of honor, now rises stronger than ever after a tale of betrayal and redemption. Our former leader, consumed by greed and darkness, was cast out by those who once pledged their loyalty. From the ashes of his treachery, the true guardians of Velskud rose, uniting to restore the legacy that was nearly shattered.\n\nWe are the new era of Velskud—unbreakable warriors, cunning strategists, and loyal companions. Our brotherhood is a beacon of hope for those who seek glory and camaraderie. Together, we will forge a future where no enemy can stand in our way.\n\nJoin our ranks and claim your place in the legend. The throne of Velskud has never been stronger, and we need heroes ready to write the next chapter of our story.\n\n##### 🎉 Since September 9th , 2024 🎉 \nA guild for all active players. \n\n##### ✅ Join Requirement\n* Play Active\n* Discord Not Required \n* Combat Level +60 \n\n##### 🚫 Kick Conditions\n* Missing raids for 3 days\n* Inactive in the Game for a week\n\n##### ⌚ Raid Schedule\n* EVERY DAY - 2:00 PM UTC\n* EVERY DAY - 9:30 PM UTC\n\n### Applications - OPEN ✅ | CLOSED",
